          "expression": "(kind = 'OPENING'::text) OR ((provider_id IS NOT NULL) AND (length(provider_id) > 0) AND (external_transaction_id IS NOT NULL) AND (length(external_transaction_id) > 0) AND (idempotency_key IS NOT NULL) AND (length(idempotency_key) > 0) AND (payload_hash IS NOT NULL) AND (payload_hash ~ '^[a-f0-9]{64}$'::text) AND (player_id IS NOT NULL) AND (round_id IS NOT NULL) AND (game_id IS NOT NULL))",
